- Health.pm:288 the per-pod "[WARN] ns/name -- reason" lines.
- lib/OCP/Cmd/Apply.pm:103 and Health.pm:364 the robocop arch warning (robocop_arch_warning).
- lib/OCP/Cmd/DeployImage.pm:295 ad-hoc override.
